    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formal register and subordinate clauses",
     "texto": [
      "A formal message identifies the matter (**Angående saksnummer 4821**), summarises the dates and attaches the relevant documents. Use **Jeg ber om at dere bekrefter mottak** («I request that you confirm receipt»). After **at**, the word order of the subordinate clause places **ikke** before the verb: **at saken ikke er registrert** («that the case has not been registered»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
